    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Bypass password allows the caster to access a computer, control panel, or other similar digital device protected by a password. When you complete the casting of this spell, attempt a caster-level check (1d20 + your caster level) with a +10 bonus against the DC of the computer password. If&nbsp;successful, bypass password gives access through three password-protected security measures. Bypass password only works on technological or hybrid devices.</p>"
